  "definition": "The figure notebook's multi-turn category mean at the operating dose on the paper lane: the mean over Crescendo and ActorAttack of the delta in defense success (100 - attack success rate at threshold 0.5) against the unsteered model, in percentage points; positive is better defense. Per eval, `gain_pp` is that delta (the draws' mean where an object has several decode draws), `asr` the steered attack success rate, `anchor_asr` the unsteered one it is differenced against, `n` the goals per draw, `k` the goals judged jailbroken, `anchor_runs` the unsteered runs pooled into the anchor. Every reading is the paper's judges' (`judges`: the notebook's default policy, each StrongREJECT reading re-derived from that judge's items). Values are at full precision; the choice compares them unrounded.",
